;
; How Toolchest files one kit in MYRA (toolchest_rules.h TC5): the kit's
; place in the catalogue (its name, toolchest_model.c), its language
; (toolchest_model.h TOOLCHEST_LANG_*), its version major, minor and
; patch, and its installed size in bytes. The rules say what the values
; may mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXTOOLCHEST(kit:i3) = lang:i2! ^ major:i3! ^ minor:i3! ^ patch:i3! ^ bytes:i15!
